description "Watto

A junk dealer who specializes in placing traps for his enemies and raining down hell from the sky.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- PT02 (Yellow/Red/Purple Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- 150% more knockback
-- 100% more special damage
-- 57% shorter
-- 300% thicker
- DL-44 Heavy Blaster Pistol (2)
-- 10% more damage/FP drain
- Fair Trade (Minigun 3)
-- Disarms/drains on hit
-- Unblockable
-- Hitscan charges
-- 99% less damage
-- 3000% slower RoF
- Busted Parts (6/5) (Flechette 4)
-- Pushes on det
-- 100% more damage
-- 110% less velocity
-- Secondary fire only
- Frag Grenade (3)
- Trip Mine (3)
- V-59 Conc Grenade (2)

^6Inventory:
- Seeker Drone ^3[CS2]

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (1)
- Dexterity (3)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (3)
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)

^3Abilities:
- Flight (Jetpack)
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS3]"